Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 11:31:37 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fujisan: use AT&T-signed a530_zap (root f83555bc)

AT&T TrustZone rejects the CN/JP-signed zap shader (scm_call 0x42000201,
rc -5), leaving SurfaceFlinger in an abort loop. Same component, SW_ID 0x14.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
